  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Finding new worlds that are worth visiting has gotten really hard. Often, the thumbnail, title and description alone do not provide enough information about the world you are considering visiting. Most of the time the thumbnail only shows a small portion of the world, is obscured by a large title/logo or doesn't show the world at all. I think a good solution could be to allow world creators to attach a few images to their world's descriptions so that users would be able to see from the in-game menu, maybe also with a rule that they have to be images of the world itself.",
